* ES-9 fixture: UPDATE and DELETE statements (SQL DML)
* Valid Natural embedded SQL demonstrating:
* - UPDATE with SET and WHERE clauses
* - DELETE with WHERE clause
* - Multiple host-variable operands
* - Distinct column and value operands in SET

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #A (A10)
  1 #B (N5)
END-DEFINE

UPDATE DDMNAME SET COL = :#A WHERE KEY = :#B

DELETE FROM DDMNAME WHERE KEY = :#B

END
